msgstr "如果选中此复选框，wpDataTables将使用自己的连接到MySQL基础。 在其他情况下，它将使用主WordPress MySQL连接。"

#: wpdatatables/templates/admin/table-settings/table_settings_block.inc.php:1141
msgid "If this is enabled, a search block will be displayed on the top right of the table, allowing to search through whole table with a single input."
